{"id":"vod_lz_58145","vodId":"58145","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"小凉宫春日的忧郁","name_cn":"小凉宫春日的忧郁","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230419-1/e291fe67e3d8921852a19e8755623cb3.jpg"},"summary":"本作是超人气动画《凉宫春日的忧郁》及原作小说派生出的四格恶搞漫画，沿用原作的大部分世界观，却在人物性格上有一定的夸张，戏剧化的变化。由京都动画制作成网络动画，每集5分钟，全25话。　　《小凉宫春日的忧郁》围绕着SOS团的日常展开，团长凉宫春日（平野绫 配音），以及团员阿虚（杉田智和 配音）、长门有希（茅原实里 配音）、实玖瑠（后藤邑子 配音）和古泉（小野大辅 配音）都基本保留了原有的个性，但同时又新增不少搞笑有趣的新设定，因此一经推出就大受欢迎。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-19 16:11:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18035_4c74d802/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18032_6b9317fa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18031_ed640938/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18034_b5d807f0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18037_4c4148a3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18036_8f494859/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18038_c942d3bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18039_8707688c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18040_66700cd0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18042_7d688faf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18041_00841016/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18043_aeb85ba7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18045_ad718323/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18044_c1ad9ef2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230418/18048_5dd8